# WhatsApp (messaging.whatsapp.meta): WhatsApp Business Cloud API. Without the access token and phone number id nothing
# is sent and every message is logged as "not sent". Use a System User token with whatsapp_business_messaging. Messages
# outside the 24-hour window must be templates approved in WhatsApp Manager (the app sends templates only). Subscribe the
# app's webhook (https://<your app>/api/messaging/whatsapp/webhook, field "messages") with WHATSAPP_VERIFY_TOKEN; its
# calls are checked with WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET (X-Hub-Signature-256).
WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN=
WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET=
WHATSAPP_VERIFY_TOKEN=
